    "## 5. Key Findings Summary\n",
    "\n",
    "### Dataset Characteristics:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **HN4 (Random Geometric Networks)**\n",
    "   - Synthetic networks with controlled geometric properties\n",
    "   - Typically larger networks with predictable structure\n",
    "   - Used for benchmarking and validation\n",
    "\n",
    "2. **PPI (Protein-Protein Interaction Networks)**\n",
    "   - Real biological networks from BioPlex3\n",
    "   - Complex interaction patterns\n",
    "   - Challenging for prediction tasks due to biological complexity\n",
    "\n",
    "3. **HG (HuggingFace Graph Datasets)**\n",
    "   - Social network data (Twitch egos)\n",
    "   - Community structure and social dynamics\n",
    "   - Smaller, denser networks\n",
    "\n",
    "### Performance Insights:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Different embedding methods show varying performance across dataset types\n",
    "- Network topology significantly impacts task performance\n",
    "- Quantum-inspired methods provide advantages in certain network structures\n",
    "\n",
    "### Next Steps:\n",
